{"pid": "mbpp:158", "slice": "mbpp", "arm": "single", "intento": 0, "reward": 0, "costo_usd": 4.4e-05, "in": 45, "out": 62, "respuesta_head": "```python\ndef pell(n):\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be non-negative\")\n    a, b = 0, 1\n    for _ in range(n):\n        a, b = b, 2 * b + a\n    return a\n```"}
{"pid": "mbpp:158", "slice": "mbpp", "arm": "single", "intento": 1, "reward": 0, "costo_usd": 4.4e-05, "in": 45, "out": 62, "respuesta_head": "```python\ndef pell(n):\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be non-negative\")\n    a, b = 0, 1\n    for _ in range(n):\n        a, b = b, 2 * b + a\n    return a\n```"}
{"pid": "mbpp:158", "slice": "mbpp", "arm": "cot", "intento": 0, "reward": 0, "costo_usd": 0.000397, "in": 81, "out": 642, "respuesta_head": "```python\ndef pell(n: int) -> int:\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be non-negative\")\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    if n == 1:\n        return 1\n\n    prev, curr = 0, 1\n    for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n        prev, curr = curr, 2 * curr + prev\n\n    return curr\n```"}
{"pid": "mbpp:158", "slice": "mbpp", "arm": "cot", "intento": 1, "reward": 0, "costo_usd": 0.000313, "in": 81, "out": 501, "respuesta_head": "```python\ndef pell(n):\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be non-negative\")\n    a, b = 0, 1\n    for _ in range(n):\n        a, b = b, 2 * b + a\n    return a\n```"}
